# Proposed NPM Package Updates

Date checked: 2026-09-09

The Node project for `egar-public-site-ui` is located in this `src` directory. The direct dependency declarations in `package.json` and the root dependency declarations in `package-lock.json` match. No manifest/lockfile drift was found. This does not mean the dependency tree is current.

## Direct dependency inventory

This application is a JavaScript/Express application using the GOV.UK One Login service header and GOV.UK Frontend. It is not a GOV.UK Prototype Kit application.

- Runtime dependencies include `@govuk-one-login/service-header`, `express@^4.16.3`, `govuk-frontend@^5.14.0`, `body-parser@^2.3.0`, `glob@^10.5.0`, `multer@2.2.0`, `nanoid@^5.1.4`, `uuid@11.1.1`, and the other packages declared in `package.json`.
- Development dependencies include ESLint 10, Mocha 11, NYC 17, C8, Sinon, Chai, Nock, and related test tooling.
- The `xlsx` dependency is a direct SheetJS tarball URL rather than a registry semver range.
- The `overrides` block pins several transitive packages, including `axios`, `body-parser`, `glob`, `qs`, `send`, `serialize-javascript`, and `xlsx`; any upgrade review must account for those constraints.

